WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.028
Today we will shape a useful object from malleable material. Our work connects with

00:00:05.028 --> 00:00:06.408
our own local community.

00:00:07.283 --> 00:00:09.566
Roll a smooth ball of soft material.

00:00:11.283 --> 00:00:15.123
Press a thumb gently into the centre and pinch the sides evenly.

00:00:15.950 --> 00:00:18.809
Smooth the rim and show how the finished bowl can stand.
